# Assignment 4 — Facade Pattern

A home theater has four devices: Amplifier, DvdPlayer, Projector, TheaterLights.
Turning them on in the right order takes about ten method calls.
HomeTheaterFacade does it in one: watchMovie(movie). endMovie() turns everything off.

## Files

Main.java - Client, uses only the Facade 
HomeTheaterFacade.java - Facade, controls all devices in the right order 
Amplifier.java, DvdPlayer.java, Projector.java, TheaterLights.java - Subsystem, the devices 
HomeTheaterException.java - The one error the Facade reports 

## How to run

Launch main